WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.999
This is my Estimation Automation Tool.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:09.999
I am developing a visual workflow for component estimation. starting here with stair geometry and input controls.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:19.999
The recorded stair view lets me inspect reinforcement geometry from different angles. It is a visual budgeting preview. rather than an approved reinforcement detail.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.999
The wall-footing screen brings quantities and an estimate summary into the same interface. The values shown remain exactly as recorded.

5
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.999
For footings. I can inspect the upper and lower reinforcement layers in the three-dimensional preview.

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.999
The beam view also shows reinforcement. stirrup closure. and an illustrated main-bar end allowance.

7
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:51.999
The wall preview extends the same visual approach to another structural component. This recording does not demonstrate CAD import or independently verified quantities.

8
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.999
My aim is practical engineering automation with understandable inputs and outputs. The tool remains under development and requires reviewed project inputs.
